{"id": "EUVD-2026-108418", "enisaUuid": "638ad762-1700-324c-94f9-20a3ec257478", "description": "Mistune from 3.0.0 before 3.3.0 contains an algorithmic complexity denial of service vulnerability in the parse_link_text function in src/mistune/helpers.py. Attackers can submit markdown with deeply nested square brackets triggering quadratic parsing time, exhausting server CPU with small crafted requests.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T19:13:26", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T19:13:26", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/lepture/mistune/security/advisories/GHSA-3q64-rw38-243v", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/mistune-3.0.0-before-3.3.0-denial-of-service-via-nested-bracket-parsing"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-115349", "GHSA-4239-8pr8-4pwv"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0169b714-4e43-3bea-930f-6d8949e536fb", "product": {"name": "mistune", "vendor": {"name": "lepture"}}, "product_version": "3.0.0 <3.3.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "853046d0-c43a-3d54-a098-084a5e3692d0", "vendor": {"name": "lepture"}}], "isExploited": false}